I just saw make updated today, so I should try rebuilding on the
failing platform sometime in the future.

As for r-sig-Windows, I would think we should revive it, especially in
light of this long thread [1] and the recent updates (comment 47 and
on) at [2], but it will require a Tomas-level guru to monitor it as
